Whitney Hodges: We like to think of it as, like, a three-phase approach to kind of create this full funnel of ads. So, client attraction ads to reach completely cold audiences, so couples who have never heard of you before, right? They haven't visited the website, they haven't seen you on Instagram, we just want to get more visibility on your brand.

